{"title": "Buthir's Wrath (Condition)", "pageid": 29972, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Buthir's_Wrath_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Buthir's Wrath Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Buthir%27s_Wrath_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Buthir's Wrath</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Buthir is enraged! <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> increased by 4, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> reduced by 2.</li></ul>\n<p><b>Tactician Difficulty:</b> \n</p>\n<ul><li>Buthir is enraged! Strength increased by 4, Armour Class reduced by 2, and has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to all physical damage. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_Rage\" title=\"SG Rage\">SG_Rage</a>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/ForceOverhead\" title=\"Status properties/ForceOverhead\">ForceOverhead</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span id=\"Sources_of_Buthir.27s_Wrath\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Buthir's_Wrath\">Sources of Buthir's Wrath</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Buthir%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Buthir's Wrath\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/45px-Rage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/60px-Rage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Buthir's Wrath\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp/30px-Rage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Rage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Buthir%27s_Wrath\" title=\"Buthir's Wrath\">Buthir's Wrath</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1468/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16910/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5430/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1024422/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expan